  "description": "Bowire OTLP protocol plugin — passive listener for OpenTelemetry traces / metrics / logs. SUTs export via OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:<port>; the workbench surfaces each received envelope channel-style for inspection. Phase 1 receives both JSON and protobuf content-types; JSON is forwarded as-is, protobuf is captured as base64 with the spec-level metadata so an upstream consumer can decode it. Phase 2 wires the canonical proto descriptors and decodes protobuf inline.",
